Package: medusa
Type: Package
Title: Multilevel Event-Related Deconvolved Signal Analysis for fMRI
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-11-12
Authors@R: c(person("Michael", "Hallquist", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "michael.hallquist@gmail.com"))
Maintainer: Michael Hallquist <michael.hallquist@gmail.com>
Description: Cross-run hemodynamic response estimation, regularized linear and
  nonlinear BOLD deconvolution, auditable event-locked interpolation,
  operator-based epoch de-mixing with observation-noise propagation,
  Empirical-Bayes precision weighting, within-run ZCA whitening,
  connectivity disattenuation, and split-wise multilevel modeling
  ('mixed_by', 'jlmer', 'meta_mixed_by') for event-related fMRI analyses.
License: GPL-3
BugReports: https://github.com/HallquistLab/medusa/issues
